(838,1594,$mw$56916FEBFE7272B0A491DD9C2C9F05B860C818F8B8C9DA319B5443CBFC7C5E96$mw$,$mw$4ccadf50da691033fa09dfff895e8b1d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1594,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":82,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","TitleEn":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?","QuestionTextAr":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","QuestionTextEn":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: عند جمع سعتين نوحّد الوحدات أولاً؛ 1 لتر = 1,000 مل. نحول 0.8 لتر إلى 0.8 × 1,000 = 800 مل. نجمع مع 750 مل ماء: 750 + 800 = 1,550 مل. المجموع يساوي 1.55 لتر، لكن المطلوب بالمليلتر.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Combine liquid volumes only after converting to a common unit; 1 litre = 1,000 mL. Convert 0.8 litres to 0.8 × 1,000 = 800 mL. Add 750 mL + 800 mL = 1,550 mL. Report millilitres as requested.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6365,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1550","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6366,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1500","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6367,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"830","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6368,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1750","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"وحّد الوحدتين إلى ملليلتر.","En":"Convert both quantities to milliliters."},{"Ar":"حوّل حجم العصير ثم اجمع الحجمين.","En":"Convert the juice volume, then add both volumes."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مزجنا 750 مل ماء مع 0.8 لتر عصير. كم مل يبلغ حجم الخليط؟","En":"We combine 750 mL water with 0.8 liters of juice. What is the total in mL?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"1550","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"1500","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1500 يهمل 50 مل من المجموع.","En":"1500 omits 50 mL from the total."}},{"LatexCode":"830","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"830 يحول 0.8 لتر إلى 80 مل خطأً.","En":"830 