Ar":"لا تستعمل عامل تحويل 100 بدلاً من 1000.","En":"Do not use a conversion factor of 100 instead of 1000."},"FormulaLatex":"1\\,\\mathrm L=1000\\,\\mathrm{mL}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$750+800=1550$","En":"$750+800=1550$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$1550-750=800$","En":"$1550-750=800$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1500 يهمل 50 مل من المجموع.","En":"1500 omits 50 mL from the total."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"830 يحول 0.8 لتر إلى 80 مل خطأً.","En":"830 incorrectly converts 0.8 liters to 80 mL."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1750 يفترض أن العصير لتر كامل.","En":"1750 assumes a full liter of juice."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نجمع الأحجام المقاسة بوحدة مشتركة.

$1\,\mathrm L=1000\,\mathrm{mL}$

1. في نموذج جمع الأحجام المدرسي نحول العصير إلى 800 ملليلتر.

2. $0.8\cdot1000=800$

3. نجمع الحجمين المعطيين بالوحدة نفسها.

$750+800=1550$

$1550$ ملليلتر

$1550-750=800$

لا تستعمل عامل تحويل 100 بدلاً من 1000.$mw$,$mw$Add volumes measured in a common unit.

$1\,\mathrm L=1000\,\mathrm{mL}$

1. In the school additive-volume model, convert the juice to 800 milliliters.

2. $0.8\cdot1000=800$

3. Add both given volumes in the same unit.

$750+800=1550$

$1550$ mL

$1550-750=800$

Do not use a conversion factor of 100 instead of 1000.$mw$),
