omits one full hour of the journey."}},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:10}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:10 ينقص عشر دقائق من المدة.","En":"11:10 is ten minutes short."}},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:20}","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\text{11:40}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:40 يزيد عشرين دقيقة على المدة.","En":"11:40 adds twenty extra minutes."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"غادر قطار الساعة 09:45 واستغرقت الرحلة ساعة و35 دقيقة. ما وقت الوصول؟","En":"A train leaves at 09:45 and travels for 1 hour 35 minutes. When does it arrive?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.","En":"Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وقت الوصول","En":"arrival time"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.","En":"Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45."},{"Ar":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$","En":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$"},{"Ar":"نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.","En":"Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\text{11:20}$","En":"$\\text{11:20}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.","En":"Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes."},"FormulaLatex":"60\\,\\mathrm{min}=1\\,\\mathrm h","Substitution":{"Ar":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$","En":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$680-585=95=60+35$","En":"$680-585=95=60+35$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":82,"PrimarySkillId":324,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"أضف الساعات والدقائق بالتتابع.","En":"Add hours and minutes in sequence."},{"Ar":"عندما يصل مجموع الدقائق إلى 60، انقل ساعة واحسب الباقي.","En":"When minutes reach 60, carry an hour and keep the remainder."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.","En":"Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وقت الوصول","En":"arrival time"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.","En":"Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45."},{"Ar":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$","En":"$9\\cdot60+45+60+35=680$"},{"Ar":"نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.","En":"Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\text{11:20}$","En":"$\\text{11:20}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.","En":"Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes."},"FormulaLatex":"60\\,\\mathrm{min}=1\\,\\mathrm h","Substitution":{"Ar":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$","En":"$680=11\\cdot60+20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$680-585=95=60+35$","En":"$680-585=95=60+35$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10:20 يهمل ساعة كاملة من مدة الرحلة.","En":"10:20 omits one full hour of the journey."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:10 ينقص عشر دقائق من المدة.","En":"11:10 is ten minutes short."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11:40 يزيد عشرين دقيقة على المدة.","En":"11:40 adds twenty extra minutes."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$لحساب وقت الوصول نضيف مدة الرحلة إلى وقت المغادرة؛ الساعة 60 دقيقة.

$60\,\mathrm{min}=1\,\mathrm h$

1. نضيف ساعة إلى 09:45 فنحصل على 10:45.

2. $9\cdot60+45+60+35=680$

3. نضيف 15 دقيقة للوصول إلى 11:00 ثم 20 دقيقة متبقية.

$680=11\cdot60+20$

$\text{11:20}$ وقت الوصول

$680-585=95=60+35$

لا تعامل الساعة كأنها 100 دقيقة.$mw$,$mw$Arrival time is departure plus duration; an hour is 60 minutes.

$60\,\mathrm{min}=1\,\mathrm h$

1. Add one hour to 09:45 to obtain 10:45.

2. $9\cdot60+45+60+35=680$

3. Add 15 minutes to reach 11:00, then the remaining 20 minutes.

$680=11\cdot60+20$

$\text{11:20}$ arrival time

$680-585=95=60+35$

Do not treat an hour as 100 minutes.$mw$),
