0 يتوقف عند 15:00.","En":"Fifty stops at 15:00."}},{"LatexCode":"65","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"65 لا يساوي مدة الفترة المحددة.","En":"Sixty-five is not the given interval duration."}},{"LatexCode":"55","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"بدأ نشاط الساعة 14:10 وانتهى الساعة 15:05. كم دقيقة استمر؟","En":"An activity starts at 14:10 and ends at 15:05. How many minutes does it last?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.","En":"Duration is the difference between ending and starting times in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"دقيقة","En":"minutes"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من 14:10 إلى 15:00 خمسون دقيقة.","En":"From 14:10 to 15:00 is fifty minutes."},{"Ar":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$","En":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$"},{"Ar":"نضيف خمس دقائق للوصول إلى 15:05.","En":"Add five minutes to reach 15:05."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$55$","En":"$55$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح الدقائق منفصلة دون حساب عبور الساعة.","En":"Do not subtract minute digits without accounting for the hour boundary."},"FormulaLatex":"D=t_2-t_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$905-850=55$","En":"$905-850=55$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$50+5=55$","En":"$50+5=55$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":82,"PrimarySkillId":324,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ الفترة عند الساعة التالية.","En":"Split the interval at the next full hour."},{"Ar":"احسب الزمن حتى الساعة 15:00 ثم أضف الدقائق المتبقية.","En":"Count the minutes to 15:00, then add the remaining minutes."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.","En":"Duration is the difference between ending and starting times in a common unit."},"Unit":{"Ar":"دقيقة","En":"minutes"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"من 14:10 إلى 15:00 خمسون دقيقة.","En":"From 14:10 to 15:00 is fifty minutes."},{"Ar":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$","En":"$(15\\cdot60+5)-(14\\cdot60+10)$"},{"Ar":"نضيف خمس دقائق للوصول إلى 15:05.","En":"Add five minutes to reach 15:05."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$55$","En":"$55$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح الدقائق منفصلة دون حساب عبور الساعة.","En":"Do not subtract minute digits without accounting for the hour boundary."},"FormulaLatex":"D=t_2-t_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$905-850=55$","En":"$905-850=55$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$50+5=55$","En":"$50+5=55$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"45 يطرح خمس دقائق بدلاً من إضافتها إلى 50.","En":"Forty-five subtracts five instead of adding it to fifty."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"50 يتوقف عند 15:00.","En":"Fifty stops at 15:00."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"65 لا يساوي مدة الفترة المحددة.","En":"Sixty-five is not the given interval duration."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المدة هي الفرق بين وقت النهاية والبداية بعد توحيد الوحدة.

