(843,1599,$mw$329B81549EA276D5642274EA06F2DF991C63C8371529492F79E4D111F71324A1$mw$,$mw$80691adf943ccd61128d1117f6247306$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1599,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":84,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما حل المتباينة $x+5<12$؟","TitleEn":"Solve the inequality $x+5<12$.","QuestionTextAr":"ما حل المتباينة $x+5<12$؟","QuestionTextEn":"Solve the inequality $x+5<12$.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: عند إضافة عدد أو طرحه من طرفي متباينة لا يتغير اتجاه إشارة المقارنة. من س + 5 < 12 نطرح 5 من الطرفين فنحصل على س < 12 − 5 = 7. العدد 7 نفسه غير مشمول لأن الإشارة صارمة، وكل عدد أصغر من 7 يحقق المتباينة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Adding or subtracting the same number on both sides of an inequality preserves the inequality direction. Starting with x + 5 < 12, subtract 5: x < 12 − 5 = 7. The endpoint 7 is excluded because the inequality is strict.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6385,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"x<17","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6386,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"x<7","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6387,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"x>7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6388,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"x\\le7","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اعزل المتغير مع الحفاظ على المتباينة.","En":"Isolate the variable while preserving the inequality."},{"Ar":"اطرح 5 من الطرفين دون تغيير اتجاه الإشارة.","En":"Subtract 5 from both sides without reversing the sign."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما حل المتباينة $x+5<12$؟","En":"Solve the inequality $x+5<12$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"x<17","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<17 يضيف 5 إلى الطرف الأيمن بدلاً من طرحها.","En":"x<17 adds five to the right instead of subtracting it."}},{"LatexCode":"x<7","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"x>7","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>7 يعكس الإشارة بلا سبب.","En":"x>7 reverses the sign without justification."}},{"LatexCode":"x\\le7","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤7 يشمل الحد الذي لا يحقق المتباينة.","En":"x≤7 includes a boundary that fails the inequality."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما حل المتباينة $x+5<12$؟","En":"Solve the inequality $x+5<12$."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح العدد نفسه من الطرفين يحافظ على اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Subtracting the same number from both sides preserves the inequality direction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من الطرفين لعزل x دون عكس الإشارة.","En":"Subtract five from both sides to isolate x without reversing the sign."},{"Ar":"$x+5-5<12-5$","En":"$x+5-5<12-5$"},{"Ar":"الحد 7 مستبعد لأن المتباينة صارمة.","En":"The boundary seven is excluded because the inequality is strict."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x<7$","En":"$x<7$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجمع والطرح لا يعكسان اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Addition and subtraction do not reverse inequalities."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff a-c<b-c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x<7$","En":"$x<7$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6+5=11<12,\\quad7+5=12$","En":"$6+5=11<12,\\quad7+5=12$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":327,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اعزل المتغير مع الحفاظ على المتباينة.","En":"Isolate the variable while preserving the inequality."},{"Ar":"اطرح 5 من الطرفين دون تغيير اتجاه الإشارة.","En":"Subtract 5 from both sides without reversing the sign."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح العدد نفسه من الطرفين يحافظ على اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Subtracting the same number from both sides preserves the inequality direction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من الطرفين لعزل x دون عكس الإشارة.","En":"Subtract five from both sides to isolate x without reversing the sign."},{"Ar":"$x+5-5<12-5$","En":"$x+5-5<12-5$"},{"Ar":"الحد 7 مستبعد لأن المتباينة صارمة.","En":"The boundary seven is excluded because the inequality is strict."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x<7$","En":"$x<7$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجمع والطرح لا يعكسان اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Addition and subtraction do not reverse inequalities."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff a-c<b-c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x<7$","En":"$x<7$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6+5=11<12,\\quad7+5=12$","En":"$6+5=11<12,\\quad7+5=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<17 يضيف 5 إلى الطرف الأيمن بدلاً من طرحها.","En":"x<17 adds five to the right instead of subtracting it."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>7 يعكس الإشارة بلا سبب.","En":"x>7 reverses the sign without justification."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤7 يشمل الحد الذي لا يحقق المتباينة.","En":"x≤7 includes a boundary that fails the inequality."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$طرح العدد نفسه من الطرفين يحافظ على اتجاه المتباينة.

$a<b\iff a-c<b-c$

1. نطرح 5 من الطرفين لعزل x دون عكس الإشارة.

2. $x+5-5<12-5$

3. الحد 7 مستبعد لأن المتباينة صارمة.

$x<7$

$x<7$ بلا وحدة قياس

$6+5=11<12,\quad7+5=12$

الجمع والطرح لا يعكسان اتجاه المتباينة.$mw$,$mw$Subtracting the same number from both sides preserves the inequality direction.

$a<b\iff a-c<b-c$

1. Subtract five from both sides to isolate x without reversing the sign.

2. $x+5-5<12-5$

3. The boundary seven is excluded because the inequality is strict.

$x<7$

$x<7$ Dimensionless

$6+5=11<12,\quad7+5=12$

Addition and subtraction do not reverse inequalities.$mw$),
(844,1600,$mw$1A3197AE79CCCDEF7D3848D6B43CB96CD2BD500FE0DF0523279AF1AC88CDC6A3$mw$,$mw$f32332c3df43c08de445b84c05eb8d1a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1600,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":84,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد جميع الأعداد الحقيقية التي تحقق المتباينة $3x-4\\ge11$.","TitleEn":"Find all real values satisfying the inequality $3x-4\\ge11$.","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد جميع الأعداد الحقيقية التي تحقق المتباينة $3x-4\\ge11$.","QuestionTextEn":"Find all real values satisfying the inequality $3x-4\\ge11$.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: في المتباينات الخطية، الجمع والطرح والقسمة على عدد موجب لا تغيّر اتجاه الإشارة. لدينا 3س − 4 ≥ 11؛ نضيف 4 للطرفين: 3س ≥ 15. نقسم على 3 الموجب فنحصل على س ≥ 5؛ تشمل مجموعة الحل العدد 5 وكل عدد أكبر منه.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Adding or subtracting a constant and dividing by a positive number preserve the inequality sign. From 3x − 4 ≥ 11, add 4 to obtain 3x ≥ 15. Divide both sides by positive 3: x ≥ 5. The endpoint 5 is included.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6389,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"x\\ge5","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6390,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"x>5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6391,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"x\\le5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6392,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"x\\ge7","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإزالة الحد الثابت.","En":"Start by removing the constant."},{"Ar":"أضف 4 للطرفين ثم اقسم على المعامل الموجب.","En":"Add 4 to both sides, then divide by the positive coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد جميع الأعداد الحقيقية التي تحقق المتباينة $3x-4\\ge11$.","En":"Find all real values satisfying the inequality $3x-4\\ge11$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"x\\ge5","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"x>5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>5 يستبعد الحد 5 رغم أنه يحقق المساواة.","En":"x>5 excludes five even though equality holds."}},{"LatexCode":"x\\le5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤5 يعكس اتجاه الإشارة عند القسمة على موجب.","En":"x≤5 reverses the inequality when dividing by a positive."}},{"LatexCode":"x\\ge7","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥7 يستبعد حلولاً صحيحة مثل 5 و6.","En":"x≥7 excludes valid solutions such as five and six."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد جميع الأعداد الحقيقية التي تحقق المتباينة $3x-4\\ge11$.","En":"Find all real values satisfying the inequality $3x-4\\ge11$."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الجمع والقسمة على موجب يحافظان على اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Adding and dividing by a positive number preserve inequality direction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف 4 للطرفين فنحصل على 3x≥15.","En":"Add four to both sides to obtain 3x≥15."},{"Ar":"$3x\\ge15$","En":"$3x\\ge15$"},{"Ar":"نقسم على المعامل الموجب 3، فيبقى الاتجاه وتشمل المساواة.","En":"Divide by positive three, preserving the direction and equality."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\ge5$","En":"$x\\ge5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس الإشارة عند القسمة على موجب.","En":"Do not reverse the sign when dividing by a positive."},"FormulaLatex":"3x-4\\ge11","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\ge5$","En":"$x\\ge5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3(5)-4=11$","En":"$3(5)-4=11$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":327,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإزالة الحد الثابت.","En":"Start by removing the constant."},{"Ar":"أضف 4 للطرفين ثم اقسم على المعامل الموجب.","En":"Add 4 to both sides, then divide by the positive coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الجمع والقسمة على موجب يحافظان على اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Adding and dividing by a positive number preserve inequality direction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف 4 للطرفين فنحصل على 3x≥15.","En":"Add four to both sides to obtain 3x≥15."},{"Ar":"$3x\\ge15$","En":"$3x\\ge15$"},{"Ar":"نقسم على المعامل الموجب 3، فيبقى الاتجاه وتشمل المساواة.","En":"Divide by positive three, preserving the direction and equality."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\ge5$","En":"$x\\ge5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس الإشارة عند القسمة على موجب.","En":"Do not reverse the sign when dividing by a positive."},"FormulaLatex":"3x-4\\ge11","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\ge5$","En":"$x\\ge5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3(5)-4=11$","En":"$3(5)-4=11$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>5 يستبعد الحد 5 رغم أنه يحقق المساواة.","En":"x>5 excludes five even though equality holds."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤5 يعكس اتجاه الإشارة عند القسمة على موجب.","En":"x≤5 reverses the inequality when dividing by a positive."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥7 يستبعد حلولاً صحيحة مثل 5 و6.","En":"x≥7 excludes valid solutions such as five and six."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الجمع والقسمة على موجب يحافظان على اتجاه المتباينة.

$3x-4\ge11$

1. نضيف 4 للطرفين فنحصل على 3x≥15.

2. $3x\ge15$

3. نقسم على المعامل الموجب 3، فيبقى الاتجاه وتشمل المساواة.

$x\ge5$

$x\ge5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3(5)-4=11$

لا تعكس الإشارة عند القسمة على موجب.$mw$,$mw$Adding and dividing by a positive number preserve inequality direction.

$3x-4\ge11$

1. Add four to both sides to obtain 3x≥15.

2. $3x\ge15$

3. Divide by positive three, preserving the direction and equality.

$x\ge5$

$x\ge5$ Dimensionless

$3(5)-4=11$

Do not reverse the sign when dividing by a positive.$mw$),
