n","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤−2 يعكس مجموعة الحل ويشمل الحد المستبعد.","En":"x≤−2 gives the wrong direction and includes the excluded boundary."}},{"LatexCode":"x>-2","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"x\\ge-2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥−2 يشمل الحد رغم أن المتباينة صارمة.","En":"x≥−2 includes the boundary despite the strict inequality."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد مجموعة حل المتباينة الخطية $-2x+6<10$ مع الانتباه للإشارة.","En":"Find the solution set of the linear inequality $-2x+6<10$, considering the sign."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة على عدد سالب تعكس اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Dividing by a negative number reverses the inequality."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 6 من الطرفين فنحصل على −2x<4.","En":"Subtract six from both sides to obtain −2x<4."},{"Ar":"$-2x<4$","En":"$-2x<4$"},{"Ar":"نقسم على −2 فنعكس الإشارة، ويبقى الحد مستبعداً.","En":"Divide by −2 and reverse the sign, keeping the boundary excluded."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x>-2$","En":"$x>-2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"اعكس اتجاه المتباينة عند القسمة على سالب.","En":"Reverse the inequality when dividing by a negative."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff a/c>b/c,\\quad c<0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x>-2$","En":"$x>-2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$x=0:\\ 6<10;\\quad x=-2:\\ 10=10$","En":"$x=0:\\ 6<10;\\quad x=-2:\\ 10=10$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":327,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارة معامل المجهول.","En":"Notice the sign of the variable coefficient."},{"Ar":"اطرح 6 ثم اقسم على المعامل السالب مع عكس الإشارة.","En":"Subtract 6, then divide by the negative coefficient and reverse the sign."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة على عدد سالب تعكس اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"Dividing by a negative number reverses the inequality."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 6 من الطرفين فنحصل على −2x<4.","En":"Subtract six from both sides to obtain −2x<4."},{"Ar":"$-2x<4$","En":"$-2x<4$"},{"Ar":"نقسم على −2 فنعكس الإشارة، ويبقى الحد مستبعداً.","En":"Divide by −2 and reverse the sign, keeping the boundary excluded."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x>-2$","En":"$x>-2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"اعكس اتجاه المتباينة عند القسمة على سالب.","En":"Reverse the inequality when dividing by a negative."},"FormulaLatex":"a<b\\iff a/c>b/c,\\quad c<0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x>-2$","En":"$x>-2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$x=0:\\ 6<10;\\quad x=-2:\\ 10=10$","En":"$x=0:\\ 6<10;\\quad x=-2:\\ 10=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<−2 يهمل عكس اتجاه المتباينة.","En":"x<−2 fails to reverse the inequality."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤−2 يعكس مجموعة الحل ويشمل الحد المستبعد.","En":"x≤−2 gives the wrong direction and includes the excluded boundary."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥−2 يشمل الحد رغم أن المتباينة صارمة.","En":"x≥−2 includes the boundary despite the strict inequality."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القسمة على عدد سالب تعكس اتجاه المتباينة.

$a<b\iff a/c>b/c,\quad c<0$

