boundary three."}},{"LatexCode":"x<-3","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<−3 لا يحقق المتباينة الأصلية.","En":"x<−3 does not satisfy the original inequality."}},{"LatexCode":"x\\ge3","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"حدد جميع القيم الحقيقية التي تحقق المتباينة $5-x\\le2$.","En":"Determine all real values satisfying the inequality $5-x\\le2$."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب في سالب واحد يعكس المتباينة.","En":"Multiplying by negative one reverses the inequality."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من الطرفين فيبقى −x≤−3.","En":"Subtract five from both sides to obtain −x≤−3."},{"Ar":"$-x\\le-3$","En":"$-x\\le-3$"},{"Ar":"نضرب في −1 فنعكس اتجاه المتباينة مع الإبقاء على المساواة.","En":"Multiply by −1, reversing direction while preserving equality."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\ge3$","En":"$x\\ge3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تغير إشارات الأعداد وحدها؛ اعكس رمز المقارنة أيضاً.","En":"Do not change only number signs; reverse the comparison too."},"FormulaLatex":"5-x\\le2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\ge3$","En":"$x\\ge3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5-3=2,\\quad5-4=1\\le2$","En":"$5-3=2,\\quad5-4=1\\le2$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":327,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"معامل المجهول سالب.","En":"The coefficient of the variable is negative."},{"Ar":"اطرح 5 من الطرفين ثم اضرب في سالب واحد مع عكس الإشارة.","En":"Subtract 5 from both sides, then multiply by negative one and reverse the sign."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب في سالب واحد يعكس المتباينة.","En":"Multiplying by negative one reverses the inequality."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من الطرفين فيبقى −x≤−3.","En":"Subtract five from both sides to obtain −x≤−3."},{"Ar":"$-x\\le-3$","En":"$-x\\le-3$"},{"Ar":"نضرب في −1 فنعكس اتجاه المتباينة مع الإبقاء على المساواة.","En":"Multiply by −1, reversing direction while preserving equality."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\ge3$","En":"$x\\ge3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تغير إشارات الأعداد وحدها؛ اعكس رمز المقارنة أيضاً.","En":"Do not change only number signs; reverse the comparison too."},"FormulaLatex":"5-x\\le2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\ge3$","En":"$x\\ge3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5-3=2,\\quad5-4=1\\le2$","En":"$5-3=2,\\quad5-4=1\\le2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≤3 يهمل عكس الإشارة.","En":"x≤3 fails to reverse the sign."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>3 يستبعد الحد المسموح 3.","En":"x>3 excludes the permitted boundary three."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<−3 لا يحقق المتباينة الأصلية.","En":"x<−3 does not satisfy the original inequality."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب في سالب واحد يعكس المتباينة.

$5-x\le2$

1. نطرح 5 من الطرفين فيبقى −x≤−3.

2. $-x\le-3$

3. نضرب في −1 فنعكس اتجاه المتباينة مع الإبقاء على المساواة.

$x\ge3$

$x\ge3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5-3=2,\quad5-4=1\le2$

لا تغير إشارات الأعداد وحدها؛ اعكس رمز المقارنة أيضاً.$mw$,$mw$Multiplying by negative one reverses the inequality.

$5-x\le2$

1. Subtract five from both sides to obtain −x≤−3.

2. $-x\le-3$

3. Multiply by −1, reversing direction while preserving equality.

$x\ge3$

$x\ge3$ Dimensionless

$5-3=2,\quad5-4=1\le2$

