de":"x\\le4","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"x\\ge4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥4 يظلل جهة اليمين مع الحد.","En":"x≥4 shades right with the boundary."}},{"LatexCode":"x>4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>4 يظلل جهة اليمين ويستبعد الحد.","En":"x>4 shades right and excludes the boundary."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"خط أعداد عليه دائرة مغلقة عند 4 والتظليل يساراً. أي متباينة تمثل ذلك؟","En":"A number line shows a filled circle at 4 with shading to the left. Which inequality describes it?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الدائرة المغلقة تشمل الحد والتظليل يساراً يمثل القيم الأصغر.","En":"A filled circle includes the boundary; left shading represents smaller values."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"التظليل يسار 4 يعني القيم الأصغر منها.","En":"Shading left of four means values below four."},{"Ar":"$0<4,\\quad4=4$","En":"$0<4,\\quad4=4$"},{"Ar":"الدائرة المغلقة تشمل 4 نفسه؛ لذلك نستخدم أصغر من أو يساوي.","En":"The filled circle includes four itself, so use less than or equal."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\le4$","En":"$x\\le4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل رمزاً صارماً مع دائرة مغلقة.","En":"Do not use a strict inequality with a filled circle."},"FormulaLatex":"(-\\infty,4]","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\le4$","En":"$x\\le4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\in(-\\infty,4]$","En":"$4\\in(-\\infty,4]$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":326,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ نوع الدائرة واتجاه التظليل.","En":"Notice the circle type and shading direction."},{"Ar":"اختر مقارنة تسمح بالحد وتمتد يساراً.","En":"Choose a comparison that includes the boundary and extends left."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الدائرة المغلقة تشمل الحد والتظليل يساراً يمثل القيم الأصغر.","En":"A filled circle includes the boundary; left shading represents smaller values."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"التظليل يسار 4 يعني القيم الأصغر منها.","En":"Shading left of four means values below four."},{"Ar":"$0<4,\\quad4=4$","En":"$0<4,\\quad4=4$"},{"Ar":"الدائرة المغلقة تشمل 4 نفسه؛ لذلك نستخدم أصغر من أو يساوي.","En":"The filled circle includes four itself, so use less than or equal."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x\\le4$","En":"$x\\le4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل رمزاً صارماً مع دائرة مغلقة.","En":"Do not use a strict inequality with a filled circle."},"FormulaLatex":"(-\\infty,4]","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x\\le4$","En":"$x\\le4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\in(-\\infty,4]$","En":"$4\\in(-\\infty,4]$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x<4 يستبعد الحد المغلق.","En":"x<4 excludes the included boundary."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x≥4 يظلل جهة اليمين مع الحد.","En":"x≥4 shades right with the boundary."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"x>4 يظلل جهة اليمين ويستبعد الحد.","En":"x>4 shades right and excludes the boundary."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الدائرة المغلقة تشمل الحد والتظليل يساراً يمثل القيم الأصغر.

$(-\infty,4]$

1. التظليل يسار 4 يعني القيم الأصغر منها.

2. $0<4,\quad4=4$

3. الدائرة المغلقة تشمل 4 نفسه؛ لذلك نستخدم أصغر من أو يساوي.

$x\le4$

$x\le4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4\in(-\infty,4]$

لا تستعمل رمزاً صارماً مع دائرة مغلقة.$mw$,$mw$A filled circle includes the boundary; left shading represents smaller values.

$(-\infty,4]$

1. Shading left of four means values below four.

2. $0<4,\quad4=4$

3. The filled circle includes four itself, so use less than or equal.

$x\le4$

$x\le4$ Dimensionless

$4\in(-\infty,4]$

Do not use a strict inequality with a filled circle.$mw$),
(849,1605,$mw$F65A3CA4CED4816835720818750CC21FB357329D67DA551AE2A732E1076F5EFE$mw$,$mw$09c65729cc49f096dccdfbab6466e07c$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1605,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":84,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كم عدداً صحيحاً يحقق $-2<x\\le2$؟","TitleEn":"How many integers satisfy $-2<x\\le2$?","QuestionTextAr":"كم عدداً صحيحاً يحقق $-2<x\\le2$؟","QuestionTextEn":"How many integers satisfy $-2<x\\le2$?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: المتباينة المركبة −2 < س ≤ 2 تعني أن س أكبر من −2 تماماً، وفي الوقت نفسه أصغر من أو يساوي 2. نعد الأعداد الصحيحة فقط داخل المجال: −1 و0 و1 و2. العدد −2 مستبعد و2 مشمول؛ لذلك عدد الحلول الصحيحة 4.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A compound inequality requires both restrictions simultaneously. For −2 < x ≤ 2, exclude −2 and include 2. Enumerate only integer values in the interval: −1, 0, 1 and 2. There are exactly four integers satisfying both conditions.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6409,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6410,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6411,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6412,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اقرأ الحد المفتوح والمغلق بعناية.","En":"Read the open and closed bounds carefully."},{"Ar":"ابدأ بأول عدد صحيح بعد الحد الأدنى وتوقف عند الحد الأعلى المسموح.","En":"Start at the first integer after the lower bound and stop at the allowed upper bound."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كم عدداً صحيحاً يحقق $-2<x\\le2$؟","En":"How many integers satisfy $-2<x\\le2$?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3 ينتج من استبعاد الحد الأعلى المسموح.","En":"Three results from excluding the permitted upper boundary."}},{"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 يشمل −2 رغم أن الحد مفتوح.","En":"Five includes −2 despite the open boundary."}},{"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 يهمل بعض الأعداد الصحيحة الداخلية.","En":"Two omits some interior integers."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"كم عدداً صحيحاً يحقق $-2<x\\le2$؟","En":"How many integers satisfy $-2<x\\le2$?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعد الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق الحدين معاً.","En":"Count integers satisfying both bounds."},"Unit":{"Ar":"عدد","En":"Count"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الحد −2 غير مشمول، لذا أول عدد صحيح هو −1.","En":"The boundary −2 is excluded, so the first integer is −1."},{"Ar":"$x\\in\\{-1,0,1,2\\}$","En":"$x\\in\\{-1,0,1,2\\}$"},{"Ar":"الحد 2 مشمول؛ نعد −1 و0 و1 و2.","En":"The boundary two is included; count −1, zero, one and two."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس الصفر ولا تخلط الحد المفتوح بالمغلق.","En":"Do not omit zero or confuse open and closed bounds."},"FormulaLatex":"-2<x\\le2,\\quad x\\in\\mathbb Z","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2-(-1)+1=4$","En":"$2-(-1)+1=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-2\\notin(-2,2],\\quad2\\in(-2,2]$","En":"$-2\\notin(-2,2],\\quad2\\in(-2,2]$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":84,"PrimarySkillId":326,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اقرأ الحد المفتوح والمغلق بعناية.","En":"Read the open and closed bounds carefully."},{"Ar":"ابدأ بأول عدد صحيح بعد الحد الأدنى وتوقف عند الحد الأعلى المسموح.","En":"Start at the first integer after the lower bound and stop at the allowed upper bound."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعد الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق الحدين معاً.","En":"Count integers satisfying both bounds."},"Unit":{"Ar":"عدد","En":"Count"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الحد −2 غير مشمول، لذا أول عدد صحيح هو −1.","En":"The boundary −2 is excluded, so the first integer is −1."},{"Ar":"$x\\in\\{-1,0,1,2\\}$","En":"$x\\in\\{-1,0,1,2\\}$"},{"Ar":"الحد 2 مشمول؛ نعد −1 و0 و1 و2.","En":"The boundary two is included; count −1, zero, one and two."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس الصفر ولا تخلط الحد المفتوح بالمغلق.","En":"Do not omit zero or confuse open and closed bounds."},"FormulaLatex":"-2<x\\le2,\\quad x\\in\\mathbb Z","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2-(-1)+1=4$","En":"$2-(-1)+1=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-2\\notin(-2,2],\\quad2\\in(-2,2]$","En":"$-2\\notin(-2,2],\\quad2\\in(-2,2]$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3 ينتج من استبعاد الحد الأعلى المسموح.","En":"Three results from excluding the permitted upper boundary."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 يشمل −2 رغم أن الحد مفتوح.","En":"Five includes −2 despite the open boundary."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 يهمل بعض الأعداد الصحيحة الداخلية.","En":"Two omits some interior integers."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعد الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق الحدين معاً.

$-2<x\le2,\quad x\in\mathbb Z$

1. الحد −2 غير مشمول، لذا أول عدد صحيح هو −1.

2. $x\in\{-1,0,1,2\}$

3. الحد 2 مشمول؛ نعد −1 و0 و1 و2.

$2-(-1)+1=4$

$4$ عدد

$-2\notin(-2,2],\quad2\in(-2,2]$

لا تنس الصفر ولا تخلط الحد المفتوح بالمغلق.$mw$,$mw$Count integers satisfying both bounds.

$-2<x\le2,\quad x\in\mathbb Z$

1. The boundary −2 is excluded, so the first integer is −1.

2. $x\in\{-1,0,1,2\}$

3. The boundary two is included; count −1, zero, one and two.

$2-(-1)+1=4$

$4$ Count

$-2\notin(-2,2],\quad2\in(-2,2]$

Do not omit zero or confuse open and closed bounds.$mw$),
(850,1606,$mw$A7385D2F3CFA338B286A9BAF082B20C97521EBD9624F969566024CDCC9F61FF1$mw$,$mw$0d73e53f172591a478863c883956b33e$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1606,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":84,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما مجموع الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق $-2\\le x<3$؟","TitleEn":"What is the sum of integers satisfying $-2\\le x<3$?","QuestionTextAr":"ما مجموع الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق $-2\\le x<3$؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the sum of integers satisfying $-2\\le x<3$?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: المجال −2 ≤ س < 3 يشمل −2 ويستبعد 3، ونبحث فقط عن الأعداد الصحيحة. القيم هي −2 و−1 و0 و1 و2. نجمعها: (−2 + 2) + (−1 + 1) + 0 = 0. تلاشت الأزواج المتعاكسة، إذن مجموع الأعداد المطلوبة صفر.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: For −2 ≤ x < 3, include −2 but exclude 3, and list integer members: −2, −1, 0, 1, 2. Add by pairing opposites: (−2 + 2) + (−1 + 1) + 0 = 0. Therefore the required integer sum is zero.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6413,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6414,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6415,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6416,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد الأعداد التي تحقق المتباينتين.","En":"Identify integers satisfying both bounds."},{"Ar":"اكتب الأعداد من الحد الأدنى المسموح إلى ما قبل الحد الأعلى ثم اجمعها.","En":"List integers from the included lower bound up to but not including the upper bound, then add."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما مجموع الأعداد الصحيحة التي تحقق $-2\\le x<3$؟","En":"What is the sum of integers satisfying $-2\\le x<3$?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 يبقى إذا أُهمل −2 من القائمة.","En":"Two remains if −2 is omitted."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يبقى إذا أُهمل −1 من القائمة.","En":"One remains if −1 is omitted."}},{"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"inco